'''''Cryptoblepharus pulcher''''', the '''elegant snake-eyed skink''', is a species of lizard in the family [[Scincidae]]. It is [[endemism|endemic]] to southern and eastern [[Australia]].<ref name="iucn status 18 November 2021" /><ref name=RDB/>

